   "start": 426.05,
   "end": 426.93,
   "text": "When it's done."
  },
  {
   "start": 427.01,
   "end": 428.11,
   "text": "And it's totally big."
  },
  {
   "start": 428.17,
   "end": 429.55,
   "text": "And everybody's like..."
  },
  {
   "start": 429.55,
   "end": 433.15,
   "text": "People are probably going to be more amazed with how much work it is."
  },
  {
   "start": 433.15,
   "end": 434.45,
   "text": "Rather than how useful it is."
  },
  {
   "start": 436.15,
   "end": 437.71,
   "text": "And then maybe out of their jealousy."
  },
  {
   "start": 438.59,
   "end": 441.47,
   "text": "Tempted to call me a retard for working on it hard."
  },
  {
   "start": 441.53,
   "end": 443.13,
   "text": "Instead of being smart for building it."
  },
  {
   "start": 443.13,
   "end": 451.4,
   "text": "And I can be like..."
  },
  {
   "start": 451.4,
   "end": 456.03,
   "text": "Why was I going with that?"
  },
  {
   "start": 456.43,
   "end": 461.69,
   "text": "No more excuses."
  },
  {
   "start": 461.85,
   "end": 463.37,
   "text": "People can't have excuses anymore."
  },
  {
   "start": 464.21,
   "end": 465.65,
   "text": "That's kind of one thing I can figure."
  },
  {
   "start": 465.75,
   "end": 467.55,
   "text": "I think I can come out of my website."
  },
  {
   "start": 467.81,
   "end": 468.51,
   "text": "Like..."
  },
  {
   "start": 468.51,
   "end": 470.99,
   "text": "People love to come up with excuses why stuff is impossible."
  },
  {
   "start": 471.67,
   "end": 473.71,
   "text": "If I can build the timeline on the website."
  },
  {
   "start": 473.91,
   "end": 476.21,
   "text": "And then memorize everything that happens."
  },
  {
   "start": 476.21,
   "end": 478.21,
   "text": "I can say..."
  },
  {
   "start": 478.21,
   "end": 480.69,
   "text": "This is what happens when you give people money."
  },
  {
   "start": 481.55,
   "end": 483.49,
   "text": "This is what happens when people don't have to work."
  },
  {
   "start": 484.25,
   "end": 485.23,
   "text": "You don't have to give them money."
  },
  {
   "start": 485.29,
   "end": 485.95,
   "text": "Just give them a room."
  },
  {
   "start": 486.29,
   "end": 487.03,
   "text": "Like the Matrix."
  },
  {
   "start": 488.61,
   "end": 489.31,
   "text": "Like Neo."
  },
  {
   "start": 489.55,
   "end": 490.97,
   "text": "Lock them in a fucking closet."
  },
  {
   "start": 491.25,
   "end": 491.87,
   "text": "Don't let them out."
  },
  {
   "start": 492.67,
   "end": 493.65,
   "text": "But just feed them."
  },
  {
   "start": 495.84,
   "end": 496.8,
   "text": "Give them health care."
  },
  {
   "start": 497.12,
   "end": 497.84,
   "text": "And they'll create..."
  },
  {
   "start": 498.6,
   "end": 501.16,
   "text": "They'll do stuff like memorize everything that happens."
  },
  {
   "start": 501.16,
   "end": 505.6,
   "text": "But that's what's wrong with the right wing."
  },
  {
   "start": 505.8,
   "end": 506.68,
   "text": "Because they want to take..."
  },
  {
   "start": 506.68,
   "end": 507.08,
   "text": "They want to..."
  },
  {
   "start": 507.08,
   "end": 507.88,
   "text": "They're like vampires."
  },
  {
   "start": 508.06,
   "end": 509.86,
   "text": "They want to suck life away from humanity."
  },
  {
   "start": 510.3,
   "end": 511.74,
   "text": "So that nobody can do anything."
  },
  {
   "start": 512.16,
   "end": 514.22,
   "text": "So that they can then waste..."
  },
  {
   "start": 514.22,
   "end": 516.84,
   "text": "Buy like 5, 10 houses and a zillion cars and everything."
  },
  {
   "start": 518.24,
   "end": 519.08,
   "text": "So..."
  },
  {
   "start": 519.08,
   "end": 522.22,
   "text": "It'd be totally boring."
  },
  {
   "start": 522.32,
   "end": 523.44,
   "text": "Like not have any animals."
  },
  {
   "start": 524.92,
   "end": 528.28,
   "text": "Because they think that this little guy is like..."
  },
  {
   "start": 528.28,
   "end": 530.96,
   "text": "In the house or something."
  },
  {
   "start": 532.18,
   "end": 533.42,
   "text": "They don't like the smell of this group."
  },
  {
   "start": 533.86,
   "end": 534.84,
   "text": "Hard enough bitching."
  },
  {
   "start": 535.54,
   "end": 538.7,
   "text": "To..."
  },
  {
   "start": 538.7,
   "end": 541.0,
   "text": "That's my other ferret up there."
  },
  {
   "start": 541.86,
   "end": 543.6,
   "text": "I'm going to..."
  },
  {
   "start": 543.6,
   "end": 545.82,
   "text": "Get going."
  },
  {
   "start": 547.82,
   "end": 550.32,
   "text": "Maybe finish this page today and get going on the other."
  },
  {
   "start": 550.56,
   "end": 553.12,
   "text": "So it's 300 million years back is what I'm working on."
  },
  {
   "start": 553.94,
   "end": 555.9,
   "text": "My mom said she call me pretty soon for a walk."
  },
  {
   "start": 556.72,
   "end": 559.06,
   "text": "And then maybe I'll ride my bike to the store and get in your teacher rank."
  },
  {
   "start": 559.08,
   "end": 560.06,
   "text": "And that'll be my exercise."
  },
  {
   "start": 561.08,
   "end": 561.44,
   "text": "Alrighty."
  },
  {
   "start": 561.56,
   "end": 562.12,
   "text": "Talk to you later."
  },
  {
   "start": 562.2,
   "end": 566.32,
   "text": "And when my battery dies I might have to go out and work in the living room."
  },
  {
   "start": 566.32,
   "end": 568.6,
   "text": "But I kind of prefer to live here in my bedroom right now."
  },
  {
   "start": 569.18,
   "end": 570.94,
   "text": "Because it's just one handed work."
  },
  {
   "start": 571.2,
   "end": 574.54,
   "text": "To add the icons and then copy and paste."
  },
  {
   "start": 574.66,
   "end": 576.66,
   "text": "You know when I'm typing a lot is when I want to be out there."
  },
  {
   "start": 577.04,
   "end": 578.14,
   "text": "I already talked to you tomorrow."
  },
  {
   "start": 578.14,
   "end": 581.02,
   "text": "You know when I want to be out there."
  },
  {
   "start": 581.02,
   "end": 581.48,
   "text": "Show you on the screen."
  },
  {
   "start": 581.48,
   "end": 581.92,
   "text": "That's what I'm doing now."
  },
  {
   "start": 581.92,
   "end": 582.9,
   "text": "Yeah, as you can see it Fro blue."
  },
  {
   "start": 582.9,
   "end": 583.62,
   "text": "Here we go."
  },
  {
